  dialogueLines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e57d42f00746134fb302a557a5387b8, type: 2}
    text: Hey, are you here for the music festival???
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e57d42f00746134fb302a557a5387b8, type: 2}
    text: I can't wait to dance all day, I heard the headliners super impressive.
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e57d42f00746134fb302a557a5387b8, type: 2}
    text: What was her name? Ebi?
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0e57d42f00746134fb302a557a5387b8, type: 2}
    text: ...Like the shrimp?
